		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほほう！
友達の　タウンマップか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-14T07:11:32" />
