	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_middleman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あさは　おなかが　へったと
ポケモンが　おこしに　くる▼
よるは　あそびつかれた
ポケモンが　ベッドを　ひとりじめ▼
ひどく　きこえるかも　しれないけど
ぼくは　しあわせ　なんだなあ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-14T03:51:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>朝は　おなかが　減ったと
ポケモンが　起こしに　くる▼
夜は　遊びつかれた
ポケモンが　ベッドを　独り占め▼
ひどく　きこえるかも　しれないけど
ぼくは　しあわせ　なんだなあ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-14T03:51:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_oldman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サンギぼくじょう　だがな
やせいポケモンも　とびだすんじゃぞ！▼
そりゃもう　じぶんの　ポケモンだけが
たより　っちゅー　わけよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T08:32:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サンギ牧場　だがな
野生のポケモンも　飛びだすんじゃぞ！▼
そりゃもう　自分の　ポケモンだけが
頼り　っちゅー　わけよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T08:32:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T02:41:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_girl1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これまでに　やったことを
わすれないように　きろくするため▽
レポートを　かいているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:17:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これまでに　やったことを
忘れないように　記録するため▽
レポートを　書いているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-28T06:57:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:18:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_boy1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんなときでも　かこと　みらいは
すてきに　おもえるけど▼
ポケモンと　あそんでいる　すてきな
じかんは　いま　なんだよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:09:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんなときでも　過去と　未来は
ステキに　思えるけど▼
ポケモンと　遊んでいる　ステキな
時間は　今　なんだよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-10T03:28:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・時計台について</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:33:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_boy1a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデクさんに　おしえてもらったこと
きみも　しりたい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:55:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:55:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデクさんに　教えてもらったこと
きみも　知りたい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:05:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:56:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
・はい　→boy1a_02
　いいえ→boy1a_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-14T03:19:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_boy1a_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶのとき　とびだすのは
ポケモンリストの　ひだりうえに▽
セットした　ポケモン　なんだって！▼
だから　おれ　そだてたい　ポケモンか
つよい　ポケモンを　セットしてるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:11:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:55:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負のとき　飛びだすのは
ポケモンリストの　左上に▽
セットした　ポケモン　なんだって！▼
だから　おれ　育てたい　ポケモンか
強い　ポケモンを　セットしてるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:11:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:56:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:56:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_boy1a_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もう　えんりょ　しちゃって！
せっかくだから　どんどん　きいてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:05:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T04:56:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もう　遠慮しちゃって！
せっかくだから　どんどん　きいてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-09T05:05:09" />
